  "why": "Sector and action category are both categorical, so the simplest honest estimate of P(action | sector) is the observed share within each sector. Every top sector has at least 271 incidents, enough for stable shares, and the chi-square test finds attack mix depends on sector (Cramer's V 0.25).",
